  "details": "Screenshots contain the dynamic island of iPhone. It should not be contained as well as other apps.\n\nHow to reproduce:\n\n1. Join to an instance.\n\n2. Take a screenshot by iOS feature (lock switch + volume button).\n\n3. The screenshot has the dynamic island (black area) in the left or right side (see attached file).\n\nEnvironments:\n\n- VRChat beta 2024.2.3(333)\n\n- iOS 17.5.1\n\n- iPhone 14 Pro\n\nNotes:\n\nThe loading screen doesn't have dynamic island in the screenshot (see attached file).",
